        "like": 1
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just as an update for anyone who comes across this, look into Unity's new constraints system as an alternative.  I've done some testing and it seems to replace most of the stuff I'd previously used IK for at a much lower CPU cost: https://docs.unity3d.com/Manual/Constraints.html",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5e9fdc03d19e806812655430",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68",
        "alias": "Evolutionary Vicuna",
        "aliasID": "65ba088fed6eefce4ca8dc62",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny.io/images/a96149971e91f0ceb638e9e86cef2b08.gif",
        "created": "2018-04-09T03:11:40.225Z",
        "name": "Tupper - VRChat Head of Community",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": null
      },
      "authorID": null,
      "boardID": "58c62f2b3cf8f8367753b2f0",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2020-04-22T05:54:11.388Z",
      "deleted": false,
      "fileURLs": [],
      "files": [],
      "imageURLs": [],
      "integrationSourceType": null,
      "internal": false,
      "itemSourceType": null,
      "likeCount": 0,
      "mentionedUserIDs": null,
      "mentionedUsers": [],
      "mergeID": null,
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5cdd1a9a0f4d2d0bf789f4f5",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "We're not closing this just yet, but as Eremite pointed out below, our preliminary looks at the native Unity Constraints system show that you can replicate most (if not all) behavior desired from custom FinalIK components at a lower resource cost.\nWe strongly suggest checking them out! https://docs.unity3d.com/2018.4/Documentation/Manual/Constraints.html\nAs an additional, somewhat related aside, Constraints also replace most (if not all) behaviors creators were previously using RigidBody \"gimmicks\", and at a much lower performance cost.\nThat being said, Constraints are not completely free performance-wise-- so don't go overboard. :)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
