      "value": "@{5c75107d0678a11a9b404cd1|full_name}: From what I understand, using constraints in tandem with FinalIK solves these issues? I've seen a number of custom leg armatures since the release, so it is possible... I just don't personally know how to set it up. 😄 Definitely an advanced creator thing!",
