      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just finished setting up an avatar with fairly heavy use of FIK, unaware this was a problem, only to find out none of it worked on remote clients. A year after being marked as \"in progress\" and no fix still. As others have said, Constraints are not a replacement for FIK. Constraints are good at replicating the behavior of Rigid Bodies/Fixed Joints, but FIK can just do so much more.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
