      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Hey Tupper if you could elaborate for me, does this mean that VRC will not support Final IK at all in the future or just that we should not expect the changes from Networked IK to be fixed? Currently, Final IK can be used quite easily by using constraints as a middle man, can we expect that functionality to stay at least semi-stable?",
